  "title": "EMPLOYERS® Empowers Agents to Work From Home",
  "summary": "With more than one-fifth of Americans being asked to “shelter in place,” agents are working from home at unprecedented rates. This can pose a number of challenges in terms of convenience, access, communication and so much more. EMPLOYERS has made a significant investment in technology that will help our agents overcome these challenges.",
